    Bug 1942206 - Implement a quick dark reader toggle in the message header. r=freaktechnik,micahilbery,tobyp


    - Expose the dark reader to all versions.
    - Enable dark reader by default.
    - Implement a header toggle to quickly disable/enable dark reader.
    - Implement a pref to show/hide the dark reader toggle.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D234629

